    "description": "You are an expert at escaping <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dogfights\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dogfights\">Dogfights</a>. When making an opposed check to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Disengage_from_a_Dogfight\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disengage from a Dogfight\">Disengage from a Dogfight</a>, you can reroll your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Pilot\" title=\"Pilot\">Pilot</a> check, taking the better result.<br><br>If you fail, you remain in the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dogfight\" title=\"Dogfight\">Dogfight</a>, but the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Gunners\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gunners\">Gunners</a> on your Vehicle do not take penalties to their attack rolls.",
